join "lil fella" center
"lil fella": Ok, so if you want to make a hoverboard, you're gonna have to know how to use a crafting station.
update "lil fella" leftmost
"lil fella": At the top here, we have the amount of each resource you have. Don't try to drag them, because it won't work.
update "lil fella" rightmost
"lil fella": Now over here is the recipes, just click on one and it'll appear in the crafting slot if you have enough resource
update "lil fella" left
"lil fella": Then just click on whatever is in that slot, and it'll craft it and appear at the top.
update "lil fella" right 
"lil fella": If you want to know what a specific item is or what resources you need to craft something, just hover over it and it will tell you.
"lil fella": Now have fun crafting!
[signal arg="craftorial_over"]
